  m_text: 'KeyBinds


    Timer

    Q: 1 Minute timer

    W: 2 Minute timer

    Num
    1-9: +X Minutes to Timer

    0: +10 Minutes to Timer

    BackSpace: Stop Timer


    Adjust
    Height

    Up Arrow: Move Up

    Down Arrow: Move Down

    =: Reset Height


    Traverse
    Scenes

    Shift + Esc: Close Program

    Z: Shapes

    X: Paint

    C: Button
    Panel

    V: Vibration Orbs

    R: Apple Tree

'
